    rating: 4.7,
    reviewCount: 21300,
    pros: [
      "No mixing, backbrushing, or thinning required — apply straight from the can",
      "Penetrates deep into wood grain instead of forming a surface film that peels",
      "Water beaded on treated pine boards for the full 12-month test period",
      "Rich, semi-transparent color that lets the wood grain show through",
      "Forgiving application — lap marks and overlap streaks self-level as it cures",
    ],
    cons: [
      "Oil-based formula has a noticeable smell for the first 24-48 hours",
      "Limited color palette compared to water-based competitors",
