    rating: 4.6,
    reviewCount: 9700,
    pros: [
      "Formulated with tung oil blend that deeply enriches cedar and redwood grain",
      "Translucent tones enhance rather than mask premium wood species",
      "Strong water repellency — highest water-beading performance in oil category",
      "Mold and mildew inhibitors built into the formula",
      "Available in tones specifically designed for cedar and redwood undertones",
